{"title":"Career Roadmap · Tax Lawyer","role":"Tax Lawyer","summary":"A Tax Lawyer specializes in legal matters involving taxation, helping individuals, businesses, investors and organizations understand, structure and resolve tax-related issues.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Taxation Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Tax Lawyer specializes in legal matters involving taxation, helping individuals, businesses, investors and organizations understand, structure and resolve tax-related issues."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tax law"},{"text":"Corporate law"},{"text":"Financial literacy"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Transaction structuring"},{"text":"Tax litigation"},{"text":"Advisory"},{"text":"Contract interpretation"},{"text":"Dispute resolution"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A tax lawyer may work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Direct taxation"},{"text":"Indirect taxation"},{"text":"GST"},{"text":"Corporate taxation"},{"text":"International taxation"},{"text":"Tax litigation"},{"text":"Tax planning within legal boundaries"},{"text":"M&A tax issues"},{"text":"Transfer pricing-related legal matters"},{"text":"Tax investigations"},{"text":"Regulatory representations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Tax Lawyer should be distinguished from a Chartered Accountant or tax accountant. Tax lawyers primarily provide legal analysis, representation, interpretation and legal structuring, while accounting professionals handle many accounting, audit and tax-computation functions."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["LL.B.","Tax Law Foundation","Tax Internship","Tax / Corporate Law Associate","Tax Lawyer","Senior Tax Associate","Tax Counsel / Specialist","Partner / Head of Tax","Independent Tax 