sments"},{"text":"Appeals"},{"text":"Tax disputes"},{"text":"Constitutional/tax-law challenges"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Legal & Financial Foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build strong knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Constitutional Law"},{"text":"Contract Law"},{"text":"Company Law"},{"text":"Law of Torts"},{"text":"Legal Methods"},{"text":"Legal Research"},{"text":"Commercial Law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Begin Learning Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Expenses"},{"text":"Profit"},{"text":"Assets"},{"text":"Liabilities"},{"text":"Equity"},{"text":"Cash flow"},{"text":"Balance sheet"},{"text":"Income statement"},{"text":"A tax lawyer must understand the business transaction behind the tax question."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Tax Law Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Income-tax principles"},{"text":"GST fundamentals"},{"text":"Corporate taxation"},{"text":"Tax procedure"},{"text":"Tax administration"},{"text":"Constitutional taxation principles"},{"text":"International taxation fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important Concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Taxable income"},{"text":"Residential status"},{"text":"Capital gains"},{"text":"Deductions"},{"text":"Tax exemptions"},{"text":"Withholding"},{"text":"Assessment"},{"text":"Appeals"},{"text":"Penalties"},{"text":"Tax authorities"},{"text":"Tax disputes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Advanced Tax Practice"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate tax"},{"text":"GST disputes"},{"text":"International tax"},{"text":"Transfer pricing awareness"},{"text":"Tax litigation"},{"text":"M&A taxation"},{"text":"Tax due diligence"},{"text":"Tax opinions"},{"text":"Tax notices"},{"text":"Tax agreements"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective should be to move from:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"I understand tax provisions.\""},{"type":"p","text":"to:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"I can apply tax law to a real commercial transaction and explain its legal consequences.\""}]},{"heading":"Tax-Law Research Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Client Question","Identify Transaction / Facts","Identify Applicable Tax","Find Relevant Statute","Check Rules / Notifications","Research Circulars / Official Guidance","Review Case Law","Analyse Facts","Identify Risks","Prepare Legal Opinion","Client Recommendation"]},{"type":"p","text":"For tax matters, checking the current law and applicable amendments is particularly important because tax rules can change frequently."}]},{"heading":"Direct Tax Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A tax lawyer should understand the broad framework of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Income taxation"},{"text":"Business income"},{"text":"Capital gains"},{"text":"Salary income"},{"text":"House property"},{"text":"Other sources"},{"text":"Deductions"},{"text":"Exemptions"},{"text":"Withholding"},{"text":"Tax assessments"},{"text":"Tax appeals"},{"text":"Penalties"},{"text":"Tax recovery"},{"text":"The goal is not necessarily to become a full-time tax accountant but to understand how legal provisions apply to financial transactions."}]}]},{"heading":"Corporate Taxation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how tax interacts with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Company formation"},{"text":"Business operations"},{"text":"Dividends"},{"text":"Capital restructuring"},{"text":"Share transfers"},{"text":"Asset transfers"},{"text":"Corporate reorganizations"},{"text":"Mergers"},{"text":"Acquisitions"},{"text":"Financing"},{"text":"Employee compensation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Tax Analysis"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Transaction","Identify Parties","Identify Consideration","Identify Assets / Rights","Determine Tax Character","Identify Appli